# Competency question: is EVERY gmeow:DocEvidence node a claim held together WITH
# its grounds? Every evidence node must carry at least one gmeow:docGroundedBy
# carrier truthmaker — an ungrounded node would be the doc-layer analogue of a DARK
# finding. The ASK is true IFF (a) at least one gmeow:DocEvidence node exists in the
# scene AND (b) no gmeow:DocEvidence node lacks a gmeow:docGroundedBy truthmaker —
# a bare existential match would pass even when an ungrounded node coexists with a
# grounded one, so the universal is enforced via double negation. Asserted lane;
# the gmeow:cqDataFile overlay supplies the self-describing scene.

PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>

ASK {
    ?evidence a gmeow:DocEvidence .
    FILTER NOT EXISTS {
        ?ungrounded a gmeow:DocEvidence .
        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?ungrounded gmeow:docGroundedBy ?truthmaker . }
    }
}
